{"id":"n28341-4-9","stage":2,"title":"다가서다 · 来临","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28341-4-9-1","ko":"가을이 다가선 것 같아.","zh":"好像秋天要来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가을이","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가을이","audio":"/audio/9c786870b862ca6b7399.mp3"}},{"text":"다가선","meaning":"来临","explanation":"다가서다：来临；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다가서다","audio":"/audio/1f7425fde11ef7bcf37a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28341","senseId":"4","lemma":"다가서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다가선","audio":"/audio/42187b09c895c00fe71f.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","explanation":"것：前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c5911194be78d7d5","term":"가을","zh":"秋天，秋季","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3","entryId":"32204","definition":"四季中的一个，介于夏天和冬天之间的季节。","pronunciation":["가을"]},{"id":"1f7425fde11ef7bc","term":"다가서다","zh":"来临","audio":"/audio/1f7425fde11ef7bcf37a.mp3","entryId":"28341","definition":"某个时候临近。","pronunciation":["다가서다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的事情或状态（-ㄴ/는 것 같다）","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition"